  "reasoning": "The facts describe two distinct sets of illegal conduct by the defendant, who was a village official. The first set involves the illegal taking of land‑transfer compensation and payments for village land sales, which fits the statutory offense of 职务侵占 (misappropriation of public property by a person in a position of authority). The second set involves the illegal appropriation of various public funds (grain subsidies, low‑income subsidies, housing assistance, and project support funds) through false reporting, embezzlement, and diversion, which corresponds to the crime of 贪污 (embezzlement of public funds by a public official). Both offenses are separately listed in the indictment, so both charges should be applied.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]职务侵占;贪污<eoa>"
}
